0:{"buildId":"7afh9cBoHBO9HIwX4Lcyt","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","$L2",null,{"toc":[{"depth":2,"url":"#requirements","title":"Requirements"},{"depth":2,"url":"#enabling-it","title":"Enabling it"},{"depth":2,"url":"#when-it-helps-and-when-it-doesnt","title":"When it helps, and when it doesn't"},{"depth":2,"url":"#steps","title":"Steps"},{"depth":2,"url":"#when-it-doesnt-work","title":"When it doesn't work"}],"children":[["$","$L3",null,{"children":"Content-defined chunking"}],["$","$L4",null,{"children":"Cut remote cache transfer bytes by 80-90% for incrementally changing artifacts with the REAPI SplitBlob/SpliceBlob extension and Bazel's --experimental_remote_cache_chunking."}],["$","$L5",null,{"children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Who this is for:"}]," anyone re-transferring large artifacts that change a\nlittle at a time: container layers, linked binaries, archives. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"What you'll\nhave at the end:"}]," clients uploading and downloading only the chunks that\nchanged. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Time:"}]," twenty minutes."]}],"\n",["$","div",null,{"data-prerequisites":true,"className":"my-6 rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface-elevated px-5 py-3","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"my-0 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-brand","children":"Before you start"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground [&>p]:my-0","children":["$","p",null,{"children":["A config file you can edit (see ",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/configuration","children":"Configuration"}],"), and Bazel 9.1.1+ or 8.7.0+."]}]}]]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"When a large build output changes slightly (a relinked binary, a container\nlayer with one file modified), its digest changes, and a conventional remote\ncache re-transfers the whole blob. Content-defined chunking (CDC) splits blobs\ninto chunks at content-derived boundaries, so clients upload and download only\nthe chunks that actually changed. In our measurements a one-file change to a\n16.8 MB tar layer re-uploaded 2.1 MB (87.5% less), and a one-source-file change\nto a linked binary re-uploaded 80.8% less."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Forge implements the server side of the\n",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/remote-apis/pull/282","children":"REAPI blob split/splice extension"}],":\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"SpliceBlob"}]," re-assembles chunked uploads (verifying the digest before\ncommitting anything), and ",["$","code",null,{"children":"SplitBlob"}]," serves chunk layouts for downloads,\nchunking blobs on demand with FastCDC 2020 when they were uploaded whole, which\nis what makes chunked downloads work for outputs produced by remote execution\nworkers."]}],"\n",["$","$L7",null,{"as":"h2","id":"requirements","children":"Requirements"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Bazel 9.1.1+ or 8.7.0+"}]," on the client, with\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"--experimental_remote_cache_chunking"}],". Avoid 9.1.0: it has a client bug that\ncorrupts outputs when the chunking flag is combined with ",["$","code",null,{"children":"--disk_cache"}],"\n(fixed in 9.1.1)."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["Chunking is ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"optional and off by default"}],". Without the configuration below,\nForge behaves exactly as before and does not advertise chunking support,\nso clients fall back to regular transfers."]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","$L7",null,{"as":"h2","id":"enabling-it","children":"Enabling it"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Add an ",["$","code",null,{"children":"experimental_chunking"}]," block to the CAS service and give it a small\nstore for chunk layouts. The index store must not verify content digests and\nmust not be the CAS store itself (naming the same store for both is rejected\nat startup):"]}],"\n","$L8","\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17"]}],"$L18"]}],["$L19","$L1a"],"$L1b"]}],"isPartial":"$@1c","staleTime":"$1d","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L1e","isPartial":"$@1f","staleTime":"$1d","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L20","isPartial":"$@21","staleTime":"$1d","varyParams":"$22"}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@23","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@24"}
